    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-merge-all/.openspec.yaml": 
"schema: story
created: <date>
"
,
    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-merge-all/proposal.md": 
"## Why

The fixture of a merge with each delta section, for the parity test of \`archive\`.

## What Changes

- The capability \`base\` gets each kind of delta.
"
,
    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-merge-all/specs/base/spec.md": 
"## ADDED Requirements

### Requirement: Fresh

The system SHALL add this requirement at the end.

#### Scenario: Added

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** an outcome follows

## MODIFIED Requirements

### Requirement: Change Me

The system SHALL behave in the new way.

#### Scenario: Old Way

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** the old outcome follows

#### Scenario: New Way

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** the new outcome follows

## REMOVED Requirements

### Requirement: Drop Me

**Reason**: The fixture drops it.

## RENAMED Requirements

- FROM: \`### Requirement: Old Name\`
- TO: \`### Requirement: New Name\`
"
,
    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-merge-all/specs/fresh-cap/spec.md": 
"## Purpose

The fresh capability of the merge fixture in the parity test.

## ADDED Requirements

### Requirement: First

The system SHALL start the capability.

#### Scenario: Started

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** an outcome follows
"
,
    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-merge-all/tasks.md": 
"## 1. Merge

- [x] 1.1 Merge the deltas
"
,
    "openspec/specs/base/spec.md": 
"# base Specification

## Purpose

The base capability of the merge fixture in the parity test.

## Requirements

### Requirement: Keep

The system SHALL keep this requirement.

#### Scenario: Kept

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** an outcome follows

### Requirement: Change Me

The system SHALL behave in the new way.

#### Scenario: Old Way

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** the old outcome follows

#### Scenario: New Way

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** the new outcome follows

### Requirement: New Name

The system SHALL keep its text when renamed.

#### Scenario: Renamed

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** an outcome follows

### Requirement: Fresh

The system SHALL add this requirement at the end.

#### Scenario: Added

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** an outcome follows
"
,
    "openspec/specs/fresh-cap/spec.md": 
"# fresh-cap Specification

## Purpose
The fresh capability of the merge fixture in the parity test.

## Requirements

### Requirement: First

The system SHALL start the capability.

#### Scenario: Started

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** an outcome follows
"
,
  },
}
`;

