"Write why the change is needed.
Sections: **Why** (1-2 sentences), **What Changes** (bullets, mark breaking changes **BREAKING**), **Capabilities**, **Impact**.
Under Capabilities, list each new capability (kebab-case path, named for a durable behavior) and each modified capability (the exact path under \`openspec/specs/\`).
Read the related specs in \`openspec/specs/\` first, and reuse an existing path.
Each listed capability gets a delta spec.
Keep it to 1-2 pages, and leave the how to \`design.md\`.
"
,
