"## Why

A fixture for the parity test of a difference from OpenSpec.

## What Changes

- A change of \`base\`.
"
,
    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-open-task/specs/base/spec.md": 
"## ADDED Requirements

### Requirement: Fresh

The system SHALL be fresh.

#### Scenario: Fresh Happens

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** a fresh outcome follows
"
,
    "openspec/changes/archive/<date>-open-task/tasks.md": 
"## 1. A

- [x] 1.1 First
- [ ] 1.2 Second
"
,
    "openspec/specs/base/spec.md": 
