## Purpose
TBD - created by archiving change open-task. Update Purpose after archive.

## Requirements

### Requirement: Fresh

The system SHALL be fresh.

#### Scenario: Fresh Happens

- **WHEN** a condition holds
- **THEN** a fresh outcome follows
"
,
  },
}
`;

